@baseUrl = http://localhost:5243
@movieId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List movies (paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?page=1&pageSize=10

### Get by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "releaseDate": "2010-07-16",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "synopsis": "A thief who steals corporate secrets through dream-sharing technology."
}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "releaseDate": "2010-07-16",
  "genre": "Science Fiction",
  "synopsis": "A thief who steals corporate secrets through dream-sharing technology."
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### Validation error (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "director": "",
  "releaseDate": "2010-07-16",
  "genre": "",
  "synopsis": ""
}
